@Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5054

### Get all exercises sorted by name
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/exercises
Accept: application/json

###

### Get chart points for an exercise
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/exercises/1/progress
Accept: application/json

###

### Get chart points for an unknown exercise
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/exercises/999999/progress
Accept: application/json

###

### Get workout history, newest first
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/workouts
Accept: application/json

###

### Get one workout with its sets
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/workouts/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Create a workout with sets
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/workouts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-10-05",
  "notes": "Upper body",
  "sets": [
    {
      "exerciseId": 1,
      "setOrder": 1,
      "reps": 8,
      "weight": 135
    },
    {
      "exerciseId": 1,
      "setOrder": 2,
      "reps": 6,
      "weight": 145
    }
  ]
}

###

### Weather forecast sample endpoint
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###
